OL,3,AClashes erupt in Barcelona after
OL,4,Athousands join Spain general strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FClashes have broken out between groups
OL,7,Fof masked men and police in Barcelona
OL,8,Fafter tens of thousands of people took
OL,9,Fpart in Spain's first general strike
OL,10,Ffor 14 years, called by the country's
OL,11,Fmain unions over housing and the high
OL,12,Fcost of living.
OL,14,FSome 120,000 people joined a
OL,15,Fdemonstration in the capital Madrid and
OL,16,Fmore than 50,000 turned out in
OL,17,FBarcelona, where footage showed masked
OL,18,Fmen setting fire to rubbish bins and
OL,19,Fsmashing shop windows as police fired
OL,20,Ftear gas.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
