OL,3,AClashes erupt in Barcelona after
OL,4,Athousands join Spain general strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport and other public services
OL,7,Facross Spain faced serious disruption.
OL,9,FSpaniards are due to vote in
OL,10,Fparliamentary elections on 29 November.
